  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2004-11-21.shnf** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 71 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Soulive opened this night for Medeski Martin and Wood [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2004-11-21.shnf**: taped by Mark Skeens; transferred by Terry Watts (http://db.etree.org/twatts); source: (DIN/90^/89hz/2' LOC) Neumann U89 > Lunatec V3 (44.1k) > DA-P1 [1]. Also: Recorded with a Neumann U89 microphone into a Lunatec V3 at 44.1k, then to DA-P1; DIN, 90-degree, 2-foot placement noted; Transferred using clones accessed through Nic Gregory; uploaded to Archive.org and bt.etree.org by Datgeek [1]",
